# Design Direction

Full doc: `docs/design-direction.md`

**North star:** Stripe Dashboard (2024) + LanceHive violet tokens in `src/index.css`.

- **60-30-10 color rule:** ~60% neutral canvas (`background`/`muted`), ~30% secondary surfaces (`card`/`sidebar`/`border`), ~10% accent (`primary`) — one primary CTA per view
- Neutral canvas (`bg-muted/30`), violet `primary` for actions/links only
- Sidebar app shell (~240px) for `/app/*` and `/admin/*`; portal uses top nav, more whitespace
- Tables over card grids; borders not shadows on list pages
- Inter body (`font-sans`), Montserrat page titles (`font-heading`), `tabular-nums` for money/hours
- CRUD in `Dialog`/`Sheet`; delete via `AlertDialog`; status as small `Badge`
- Light default + dark supported; no gradients, glassmorphism, or marketing heroes in app routes
- Portal: same system, read-only, no mutation UI
